WEBVTT

00:13:28.956 --> 00:13:32.156
I had 20 dollars, 00.03,

00:13:32.156 --> 00:13:34.396
I had to pay the bills, pay the lawyer,

00:13:34.436 --> 00:13:35.876
take care of my family.

00:13:35.916 --> 00:13:38.876
And I swear to you, at that time ...

00:13:38.916 --> 00:13:42.436
I mean, honestly, I said:
“I have done everything in my power.

00:13:42.476 --> 00:13:44.036
I am exhausted.

00:13:44.356 --> 00:13:45.916
What can I do with three cents?”

00:13:45.956 --> 00:13:48.076
I didn't even get angry,
I didn't get upset.

00:13:48.076 --> 00:13:50.796
I remember this vividly,
it was a beautiful Bay Area day,

00:13:50.836 --> 00:13:54.036
anyone who lives there knows,
4pm, little bit of a windy breeze.

00:13:54.036 --> 00:13:56.156
The sun was still there,
it was just idyllic.

00:13:56.196 --> 00:13:58.836
And I remember I started laughing,
look at the receipt,

00:13:58.836 --> 00:14:00.396
and a couple of people behind me